<title>JAPAN: PLDT launches $300 mln global bond-Goldman.</title>
<headline>PLDT launches $300 mln global bond-Goldman.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following global bond issue was announced by lead manager Goldman Sachs on Monday:</p>
<p> BORROWER Philippine Long-Distance Telephone</p>
<p> AMT	$300 million</p>
<p> MATURITY 6 March 2017  </p>
<p> PAY DATE	   6 March 1997</p>
<p> LAST RATING     S&amp;P BB+, Moody's BA2</p>
<p> LEAD MANAGER    Goldman Sachs, Citicorp</p>
<p>NOTES: Price talk is 170-175 basis points over the 6.5 percent U.S. Treasury bond due in November 2026. Final pricing is February 25, New York time.</p>
<p>---Tokyo Treasury Desk +81-3-5473-3748</p>
</text>
